{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach visible object, take if possible, check properties, move to destination. If heavy, call for help. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CallForHelp    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <SubTree ID = RobotTasks    />",
    "BT": {
